T* (Both MOS gates are tied to LCD_CTP_3V3_SW.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (When LCD_CTP_3V3_SW is off, the MOSFETs are off and the body diodes are reverse-biased,) Tj
T* (so VCC_3V3_MAIN cannot back-power the unpowered CST820 touch controller through I2C.) Tj
