(Note:) Tj
T* (ES8389_SCL/ES8389_SDA is separated from SYSTEM_I2C by a pair of N-MOS transistors \(2N7002DW\).) Tj
T* (The SYSTEM_I2C end is pulled up to VCC_3V3_MAIN.) Tj
T* (The ES8389 end is pulled up to AUDIO_3V3_SW.) Tj
T* (The gate terminals of both MOS transistors are connected to AUDIO_3V3_SW.) Tj
T* (When AUDIO_3V3_SW is off, both MOSFETs are in the cut-off state, and their body diodes are reverse-biased. ) Tj
T* (Therefore, VCC_3V3_MAIN cannot back-power the unpowered ES8389 through the I²C bus.) Tj
