(Note:) Tj
T* (CAM_SCL/CAM_SDA is separated from SYSTEM_I2C by a pair of N-MOS transistors \(2N7002DW\). ) Tj
T* (The SYSTEM_I2C terminal is pulled up to VCC_3V3_MAIN.) Tj
T* (The camera I2C is pulled up to CAM_DOVDD_2V8_SW. ) Tj
T* (The gates of the two MOS transistors are connected to CAM_DOVDD_2V8_SW.) Tj
T* (When CAM_DOVDD_2V8_SW is turned off, the MOSFET is in the closed state and the body diode is in reverse bias. ) Tj
T* (Therefore, VCC_3V3_MAIN cannot provide a reverse power supply to an unpowered camera via I2C.) Tj
